 'quarantine',case when p.entity_type='rejected-html-captures'then'Old official URL returned404; retain acquisition evidence without public case authority.'else'JPML3108 caption conflicts with independently captured court metadata; hold this caption-bearing observation without changing correct master profiles.'end,
